# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trendora API key configuration
#
# The SINGLE source of truth for both API keys is the git-ignored
# `local.properties` file at the project root (the same file that holds your
# Android SDK path). This `.env.example` file is retained only as reference
# documentation and is NOT read by the build.
#
# To configure the app, create or edit `local.properties` and add:
#
#   GNEWS_API_KEY=YOUR_GNEWS_KEY
#   GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_KEY
#
# - GNEWS_API_KEY:  Get a free key at https://gnews.io/
# - GEMINI_API_KEY: Get a free key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Never commit `local.properties` or a real key. Both keys are injected into
# the app via BuildConfig at build time and are never hardcoded in source.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
